Error [jet.SpreadWithoutVariadic]: `fixed` doesn't accept a spread argument
  --> tests/ui/spread_bad_call.jet:7:11
    |
  7 |     fixed(...xs)
    |           ^^^
 Why: Call spread `f(...xs)` only works when the callee has a final variadic parameter
 Fix: Pass arguments individually, or call a function whose last parameter is variadic
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1312
